951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 43 of them, the most of any pair. In 2026 so far, February to March sat at 7% of normal and March to April at 23%, then June to July came back at 140%. Grid 22320 had its driest year in 2022 at 43%.</p>"}
